WEBVTT

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:07.540
I will destroy.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.730
Because you save.

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:18.680
Down. He's going down.

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:20.520
Hey, who said you could do that?!

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.250
You... are the enemy.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:30.860
What's wrong, Akira?

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:33.030
Force retrieve Vector-2!

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:34.520
Right!

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:42.940
Did Akira's voice destabilize the word?

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:44.870
His Verbalism Ability is impressive.

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:48.610
Then I shall set it loose... That wish.

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:52.980
Rejoice. I shall now set you free.

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:14.500
<i>The world is engulfed by an unvoiced scream</i>

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:20.440
<i>and I wait for it to reach and stir</i> <i>a certain someone's heart</i>

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:26.250
<i>With strength flowing to the edges of our souls</i>

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:32.520
<i>we set out into the white</i> <i>morning haze, without hesitation</i>

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:35.460
<i>I want to know everything about you</i>

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:45.460
<i>But just when I thought</i>
<i>I had you, you were gone</i>

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>It's love, affection, passion, expression</i>

00:01:54.540 --> 00:02:01.150
<i>These tightly-sealed, silent lips</i>

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:05.520
<i>gently reply back in kind</i>

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:09.790
<i>And with love, affection, passion, expression</i>

00:02:09.790 --> 00:02:16.300
<i>Now, from the last of the words I couldn't find,</i>

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:25.000
<i>the music begins</i>

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:39.510
"Shatter! The One I Must Strike Down"

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:48.990
This world must be boring for you.

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:55.060
The world you desire... That would be...

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:04.850
Please... Save me...

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:07.180
Please... Save...

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:09.350
"Save me," she says.

00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:14.090
How nice for you. Those are the words you wanted to hear, yeah?

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:15.690
Who are you?

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:19.690
You, the one borrowing her voice to speak... Who are you?

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:26.270
Akira! Thank goodness!

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:31.540
What's gotten into you?

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:34.030
There's an enemy. I'm going to launch.

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:37.710
Y-You can't push yourself like that!

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:41.580
Hey, hold it! Your Vector is a wreck anyway!

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:43.080
Not a problem.

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:48.420
Hey! You bumped into me first!

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:50.560
I just brushed your shoulder a bit!

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:54.400
What? I touched it first!

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:56.400
Put your foot on the gas, moron!

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:59.400
Where am I supposed to drive in this traffic, you idiot?

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:00.940
Verbalize.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.470
Verbalize!

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:03.060
"Verbalism"

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:07.310
The M.J.B.K.'s influence is manifesting everywhere.

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:09.980
The conflicts are spread out at this point,

00:04:09.980 --> 00:04:12.280
but if the word corrosion rate rises much more,

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:15.080
it could develop into major riots.

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.620
It's an M.J.B.K. that amplifies hostility.

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:20.160
If we don't do something about it fast, we're in for trouble.

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:23.590
Don't let your guards down, Tsutomu, Hayato.

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:27.100
You jerk. You bastard.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:29.120
Teki. ["enemy"]

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.600
Sousei Gattai.

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:34.000
Pierce!

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:37.600
Aquarion!

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:42.480
--Ryu!
--Ryu!

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:42.480
"Ryu"

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:45.850
All right, let's get this show on the road, you four-eyed pervert!

00:04:45.850 --> 00:04:47.280
Stop with your idiotic prattle.

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:51.020
We should be cautiously reading the situation, you third-rate joker.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:53.290
Huh? What are you on about?

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:56.130
You've let your popularity with the ladies go to your head a bit too much.

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:58.130
School swimsuits are lame, you know?

00:04:58.130 --> 00:05:01.360
How dare you?! What gives you the right to mock school swimsuits?

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:02.870
Oh, shove it!

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:06.700
Take back calling me third-rate!
I'm at least second-rate!

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:07.700
Shut up!

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:11.140
If you're going to mock a part of my identity, you're just another enemy!

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:12.510
Right back at you!

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:14.840
Anyone who looks like they're popular with the ladies is my enemy, stupid!

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:18.810
Did no one teach you that the first to say stupid is the stupid one? You fool!

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:22.650
Sakurako, there's some data about the current M.J.B.K. that caught my eye.

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:25.850
What are you two doing? Cut it out!

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:27.560
You and your unnecessarily huge tits can shut up!

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.890
What are you saying?

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:32.490
Could this also be because of the M.J.B.K.?

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:34.500
I think it's time you stop lying about your age!

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:37.670
Quit sitting there quietly and give us an order already!

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:40.340
Command the operation, you middle-aged woman!

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:42.840
Sakurako... They're calling for you.

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:45.540
Who are you calling leftovers?!

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:49.080
I... I like the way you're so well-aged, Sakurako.

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:52.050
Either pick a fight or profess your love for me, but choose one!

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:54.920
That's not all you'll be hearing from me, you dolt!

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:57.110
I could say the same!

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:02.690
Vector-6, why are you launching without orders?

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:05.090
Uminagi, you can't just act on your own!

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:07.890
It's not me!

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:11.060
Then who?

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:14.540
We're going to Gattai, Hayato Kujyo.

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:18.130
Akira! What are you doing in Vector-6?

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:20.710
Here I come.

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:23.580
Don't you dare! Who would ever want to do it with you?

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:27.380
Sousei Gattai, fly!

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:30.550
You idiot! Stop, it won't work!
This is Karan's and my...!

00:06:30.550 --> 00:06:34.220
Aquarion!

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:37.890
Absurd.

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:39.920
It feels so good.

00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:43.570
Big Brother got beat!

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:45.400
I don't care!

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:48.900
Gai.

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:48.900
"Gai"

00:06:49.640 --> 00:06:52.130
He really went out there?

00:06:53.940 --> 00:06:56.450
After a vote from the board of directors,

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:59.080
the current chairman,
Mr. Georges, will be replaced.

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:04.120
Mr. Subete Kenzaki is newly appointed as Chairman/CEO.

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:06.920
<i>Non</i>! <i>Impossible</i>!

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:12.130
I have to hand it to you.

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:15.930
I didn't expect you to take the company back so easily.

00:07:15.930 --> 00:07:19.170
Only because you put everything in place for me.

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:23.440
With this, he should be able to rest in peace, at least a little.

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:29.810
Well then, I think it's back to some research for me...

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:33.020
You're so kind.

00:07:33.020 --> 00:07:37.520
Taking back your mother and father's company for me.

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:40.190
I've told you not to show up unbidden.

00:07:40.190 --> 00:07:45.490
Was leaving wise? The battle in the Logos World hasn't finished yet.

00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:48.830
If he's going to be crushed under the weight of his own wish,

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:52.670
there's no need for me to get involved. More importantly...

00:07:52.670 --> 00:07:55.300
About earlier? What's the harm?

00:07:55.300 --> 00:08:00.040
It's not like anyone other than you can see me.

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:02.710
A ghost has no business poking her nose in.

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:05.810
That's a cold way to put it.

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:12.050
Your power is identical to what your father called the Book of Verbalism.

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:16.750
And the one who taught you to use it was me, too.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:24.170
In the frozen time, created by writing,

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:28.670
you trained extensively to control the power of Verbalism.

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:31.510
It may have been a mere moment in this world's time,

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:36.170
but how many days and months did you spend there?

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:41.350
Were you there so long that your heart's frozen over?

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:46.520
Still, I like you better as you are now.

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:50.080
Those eyes, so like his.

00:08:52.030 --> 00:08:56.430
It's been 12,000 years since someone last gazed at me.

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:58.530
I think you're misunderstanding.

00:08:58.530 --> 00:09:01.940
You're no more than a tool to accomplish my goals.

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:07.370
Yes, I'm fine with that.

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:18.090
Why do I have to Gattai with you?

00:09:18.090 --> 00:09:19.420
Are you going to get in my way?

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:22.460
--What?
--Are you my enemy?

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:25.260
Hey! What're you doing to Big Brother?

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:27.600
Kaibuki, calm down.

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:31.070
Shut up. Anyone who gets in the way is my enemy.

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:32.630
Teki! Teki!

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:36.410
Everyone is your enemy!

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:37.410
Teki...

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:40.240
That M.J.B.K. is reacting to Akira!

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:45.810
Teki!

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:52.820
Our link to Vector-4 and Vector-5 is cut.

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:55.820
Tsutomu! Hayato! Respond, please!

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:58.930
Transfer control of Kaibuki's Vector-6 here.

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:00.100
We're forcing him to return.

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:01.760
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:05.770
Big Brother...

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:09.440
Ts-Tsutomu, Hayato... What should we do?

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:13.640
What will we do? We've already lost machines as it is.

00:10:13.640 --> 00:10:17.950
We'll just have to use what we have to recover.

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:19.310
Sakurako...

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:22.880
Why not put in an emergency request for the one at Saigon Base?

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:27.160
I don't know that it would arrive in time,

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:30.720
but Akira might be able to pilot it.

00:10:32.490 --> 00:10:33.830
What's this?

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:36.970
It's at the branch in Vietnam. The final Vector.

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:39.500
--Kento!
--Is that true?!

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:43.040
It is. But it's not usable.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:44.870
Wh-Why not?

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:47.980
Because, 12,000 years ago...

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:50.740
...that Vector is the one that destroyed the legend!

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:11.500
I'm sure that even with all this here, it won't be enough.

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:15.540
But this time they'll shoot. I'm serious. Okay?

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:16.870
Akira...

00:11:16.870 --> 00:11:21.680
Since there's no telling what you'll do if left alone right now.

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:23.680
The Vectors we've used up to this point

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:27.180
were assembled using modern technology

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:30.850
based on blueprints excavated from ancient ruins.

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:35.760
But the last Vector we were talking about is fundamentally different.

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:39.590
Deep within the ruins of the writing culture,

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:43.270
it was worshiped at what seemed to be a central altar.

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:48.570
It was like it had been sealed away and even approaching it was taboo.

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:51.940
And, on the walls, this was written:

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:54.440
"Destroyer of Legends."

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:57.080
You don't mean to tell me...

00:11:57.080 --> 00:12:00.220
That Vector is what we managed to restore from it.

00:12:00.220 --> 00:12:04.090
However, it was difficult to call it a success.

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:08.560
No matter how we tuned it, the machine never once activated.

00:12:08.560 --> 00:12:10.060
More than that,

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:14.600
there were rumors of some mysterious magical energy in the machine.

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:19.100
After all, the engineers and test pilots involved in restoring it

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:22.400
all suddenly vanished.

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:25.070
During one activation test.

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:29.140
On top of that, the maintenance crew who were just cleaning it

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:33.320
all developed severe cognitive impairments.

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:35.450
It's like something out of the occult!

00:12:35.450 --> 00:12:38.290
How can we make Akira pilot a machine like that?

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:42.090
You're right. I know that.

00:12:42.090 --> 00:12:46.090
But how else are we going to save Hayato and Tsutomu?

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:47.430
That's...

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:53.270
Though, that's only if it arrives from Saigon Base in time.

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:56.330
I see. So all of you are, too...

00:12:57.770 --> 00:12:59.600
In that case...!

00:12:57.840 --> 00:12:59.310
"Enemy"

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:09.180
Nothing gets my blood boiling like a good fistfight!

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:11.120
Akira, stop!

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:14.390
Akira! What are you doing?!

00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:17.460
Huh? What?

00:13:17.460 --> 00:13:18.950
What is it?

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:23.970
It's coming.

00:13:23.970 --> 00:13:25.970
It will soon arrive.

00:13:25.970 --> 00:13:28.470
Arrive? What will?

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:32.470
That which comes to a savior...

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:34.140
It can only be...

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:38.040
...destiny, of course!

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:51.730
The Logos Monument? Why?

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:58.230
Looks like it's regained consciousness in response to your awakening.

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:00.840
I see. So this is it.

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:05.500
Yes, the accursed power which once burned him and me.

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:10.180
Wh-What is this?

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:12.210
I-I-It's creepy.

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:15.680
I must consume.

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:18.190
Kiryu. The traitor.

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:19.220
Kiryu?

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:25.090
You who are strong of will, what is it you seek?

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:28.360
What do I seek?

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:35.860
It seems what you seek and what we must destroy are the same.

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:41.040
Thus we have awakened.
Thus we have resonated.

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:46.710
Then we shall bestow it upon you...
The power that consumes all.

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:55.420
Wait, Akira!

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:56.630
It's dangerous!

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:58.120
Akira!

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:18.780
What is this?

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:20.920
It's the enemy. The enemy.

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:23.490
--He is my enemy.
--An enemy.

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:26.980
Akira Kaibuki is the enemy? The enemy.

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:35.460
Vector-3!

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:37.130
--Quantum engine has failed!
--Verbalize.

00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:37.200
"Verbalism"

00:15:37.130 --> 00:15:38.930
Vector-6 is showing the same pulse.

00:15:38.930 --> 00:15:41.000
Launch gate is opening on its own.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:43.100
--We can't control it from here!
--Verbalize.

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:44.470
Kokone Kikogami, Karan Uminagi...

00:15:44.470 --> 00:15:46.270
Both Verbalism gauges show no readings.

00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:48.110
Vital signs are also at dangerous levels.

00:15:48.110 --> 00:15:51.280
It seems Vectors 3 and 6 have both launched together.

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:53.950
--I'm going out, too!
--Tsukigane! Wait!

00:15:53.950 --> 00:15:55.780
I'll bring them back!

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:57.950
This is reckless! How would you even do that?

00:15:55.850 --> 00:16:01.720
"Voice ID

00:15:55.850 --> 00:16:01.720
Sakurako Soda"

00:15:57.950 --> 00:16:01.780
I don't know. But I can't let Akira do everything!

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:07.030
Akira is the enemy...

00:16:07.030 --> 00:16:08.960
Akira is the enemy.

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:12.300
My enemy. You are my enemy.

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:16.000
Teki. Teki.

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:19.640
It's like that M.J.B.K. is acting in response to Akira.

00:16:19.640 --> 00:16:20.810
Huh?

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:23.980
To strike down my enemies.
The power I need to do that...

00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:25.850
Come to me!

00:16:25.850 --> 00:16:27.650
Akira!

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:44.570
That's...

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:47.000
What is that Vector?

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:48.870
No, that machine is...

00:16:48.870 --> 00:16:53.840
Could that be the Destroyer of
Legends you were talking about?

00:16:53.840 --> 00:16:55.580
I can't believe it!

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:58.080
It instantly teleported here from the base in Vietnam!

00:16:58.080 --> 00:16:59.350
Without any pilot!

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:01.350
The Logos Monument was its activation key, then.

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:04.510
--Sakurako!
--The final vector, Vector-Ga.

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:12.360
Verbalize.

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:15.390
"Verbalism"

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:15.390
"Akira Kaibuki"

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:20.070
I'm being pulled in!

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:27.270
"San"

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:36.950
Teki. Teki.

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:41.390
What's going on? We've Gattaied, but my cockpit isn't changing.

00:17:46.930 --> 00:17:50.060
I will consume all.

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:54.740
I will consume all.

00:17:52.770 --> 00:17:54.840
"Enemy"

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:57.000
Devour all.

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:12.650
What is going on?

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:16.490
It's swallowing the M.J.B.K. along with its words.

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:18.760
But this is just like...

00:18:18.760 --> 00:18:20.430
I understand it now.

00:18:20.430 --> 00:18:24.260
Why the monument worked as a counter to the Book of Verbalism.

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:31.810
It's because it's a being that devours words, concept and all.

00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:33.170
Then...

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:36.780
The M.J.B.K.s and the monument are the same sort of beings.

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:39.950
Having touched his voice, I understand.

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:45.790
Savior... That word has lost its reason for Akira.

00:18:45.790 --> 00:18:47.960
With no reason or goal,

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:53.460
he's only driven by an impulse that tells him he must become one.

00:18:53.460 --> 00:18:58.400
Because he can only demonstrate his existence by saving something.

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:02.300
Someday, he will notice.

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:04.840
That, at some point, he destroyed even those he tried to save

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:09.340
because he decided they were his enemies.

00:19:09.340 --> 00:19:12.470
And so, he will continue to seek enemies.

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:18.050
All that lies at the end of his path is ruin.

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:20.720
The word corrosion rate is rising!

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:22.660
It's exceeded 80%!

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:27.560
That Aquarion is consuming the M.J.B.K.'s word and concept.

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:31.570
It's the same as if there were two M.J.B.K.s fighting there!

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:35.300
Does that mean Akira's turned into an M.J.B.K.?

00:19:40.180 --> 00:19:44.350
I will strike down the enemy, the threat!

00:19:44.350 --> 00:19:48.510
Stop, Akira! Everyone is trapped inside!

00:19:49.550 --> 00:19:52.350
The enemy! It's the enemy!

00:19:52.350 --> 00:19:55.850
They're all enemies! Enemies!

00:19:56.860 --> 00:19:59.590
Akira!

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:01.700
I'm just a savior.

00:20:01.700 --> 00:20:03.790
For I am the savior.

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:09.700
Enemies!

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:11.870
We are enemies!

00:20:13.210 --> 00:20:15.040
Stop already!

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:16.740
Maia!

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:23.380
Maia! Run!

00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:30.060
Save me.

00:20:29.260 --> 00:20:31.250
"Save me"

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:52.080
I acknowledge it... It's true
I was seeking enemies.

00:20:52.450 --> 00:20:56.120
"Seek"

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:56.580
But, even so, I...

00:20:57.990 --> 00:21:03.160
Te... ki...

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:00.320
"Enemy"

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:06.590
...am a savior!

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:06.630
"Save"

00:21:06.590 --> 00:21:08.600
Maia, come along!

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:10.770
Sure!

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:14.600
Even if there's nothing at the end of it all,

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:18.010
I will continue to bring salvation.

00:21:18.010 --> 00:21:19.440
As far as I must.

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:21.840
Yes, as far as we must.

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:23.610
Into infinity.

00:21:27.480 --> 00:21:28.510
"Salvation"

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:32.390
"Savior Mugen Punch"

00:21:32.820 --> 00:21:36.120
Fist of Unending Salvation!

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:51.900
Teki! Teki! Teki!

00:22:01.050 --> 00:22:03.020
What were we doing?

00:22:05.050 --> 00:22:07.320
I wouldn't have it any other way.

00:22:07.320 --> 00:22:10.160
Come along, Nesta.
We'll start the preparations.

00:22:10.160 --> 00:22:11.830
Preparations?

00:22:11.830 --> 00:22:17.420
To destroy the world he'll save,
I will awaken Aquarion Logos.

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:25.770
<i>I want to lend you a true voice</i>

00:22:35.850 --> 00:22:41.190
<i>With the warmth of salvation,</i>
<i>I raise my hand into the sky</i>

00:22:41.190 --> 00:22:45.930
<i>and everything in the world gains its true colors</i>

00:22:45.930 --> 00:22:48.600
<i>(Focus) A sound that was once hidden</i>

00:22:48.600 --> 00:22:51.700
<i>(on the goal) will connect us now</i>

00:22:51.700 --> 00:22:54.200
<i>Try to understand that, okay?</i>

00:22:54.200 --> 00:22:56.640
<i>So, are you ready?</i>

00:22:56.640 --> 00:22:59.440
<i>(heart and soul) These silent teardrops</i>

00:22:59.440 --> 00:23:02.040
<i>(narrow escape) that flow forth now</i>

00:23:02.040 --> 00:23:05.550
<i>(enamored) are proof of that person's existence</i>

00:23:05.550 --> 00:23:12.050
<i>You can't go inside your heart all alone</i>

00:23:12.050 --> 00:23:14.620
<i>I will hesitate no more</i>

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:19.790
<i>I want to lend you a true voice</i>

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:25.000
<i>A useful life, a sparkling utopia</i>

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:34.110
<i>When your heart and voice</i> <i>tremble together, you'll surpass all</i>

00:23:34.110 --> 00:23:37.510
<i>So go for your heart</i>

00:23:50.260 --> 00:23:51.960
Our next reading theater performance!

00:23:51.960 --> 00:23:53.760
I'm an old lady again?

00:23:53.760 --> 00:23:56.160
You want me to memorize such a large script in time for the school festival?

00:23:56.160 --> 00:23:59.630
With seminar, work for the senator, and debate club, I won't have time for sleep!

00:23:59.630 --> 00:24:00.770
Is the manager a total sadist?

00:24:00.770 --> 00:24:02.100
You read those lines so smoothly!

00:24:02.100 --> 00:24:03.340
I wish I could do that!

00:24:03.340 --> 00:24:04.340
You shouldn't lie.

00:24:04.340 --> 00:24:05.610
Episode 18.

00:24:04.940 --> 00:24:06.870
"Episode 18: Howl! An Honest Beaten Dog"

00:24:05.610 --> 00:24:07.310
"Howl! An Honest Beaten Dog."

00:24:07.310 --> 00:24:08.310
Hayato...

00:24:08.310 --> 00:24:09.800
You <i>tsundere</i>!
